---
layout: base.njk
title: Minds meet possibilities
description: LEACS is an open seminar series at the University of Jyväskylä exploring cognitive science, human–computer interaction, attention, perception, and research methods.
hero:
  eyebrow: Open seminar series · University of Jyväskylä
  line1: Curious minds.
  line2: Shared possibilities.
  text: Exploring how we think, how we interact, and how technology shapes our world. A seminar series for conversations across disciplines.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ hero.eyebrow }}</p>
      <h1>{{ hero.line1 }}<br><em>{{ hero.line2 }}</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">{{ hero.text }}</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-bright" href="{{ '/talks/' | url }}">Discover the talks <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button button-ghost" href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">Get to know LEACS</a></div>
      <ul class="hero-topics" aria-label="Topics">
        <li>Cognitive science</li><li>Human–computer interaction</li><li>Research methods</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-media">
      <img src="{{ '/content/images/cognition-interface.webp' | url }}" alt="An illustrated blue human head with neural connections facing a glass interface above a calm lake" width="1400" height="933" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
      <svg class="scanpath" viewBox="0 0 600 500" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <polyline class="scan-line" pathLength="1" points="150,120 275,205 300,330 470,230 520,140 430,350"/>
        <g class="fixations">
          <circle cx="150" cy="120" r="16" style="--i:0"/><circle cx="275" cy="205" r="24" style="--i:1"/><circle cx="300" cy="330" r="12" style="--i:2"/>
          <circle cx="470" cy="230" r="30" style="--i:3"/><circle cx="520" cy="140" r="14" style="--i:4"/><circle cx="430" cy="350" r="19" style="--i:5"/>
        </g>
      </svg>
      <figcaption class="gaze-tag"><span class="mono">fixation 04 · 312 ms</span></figcaption>
      <div class="aoi-corner" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </figure>
  </div>
  {% set nextTalk = collections.upcoming[0] %}
  {% if nextTalk %}
  <div class="container">
    <a class="next-session" href="{{ nextTalk.url | url }}">
      <span class="next-label mono"><span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Next session</span>
      <span class="next-date">{% if nextTalk.data.starts %}<time datetime="{{ nextTalk.data.starts | iso }}">{{ nextTalk.data.starts | dateLabel }}</time> · {{ nextTalk.data.starts | timeLabel }}{% elif nextTalk.data.plannedMonth %}{{ nextTalk.data.plannedMonth | monthLabel }}{% else %}Date to be announced{% endif %}</span>
      <span class="next-title">{{ nextTalk.data.title }}</span>
      <span class="next-speaker">{{ nextTalk.data.speaker }}</span>
      <span class="next-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="section container" aria-labelledby="agenda-heading">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 · On the agenda</span><h2 id="agenda-heading">Ideas worth gathering for.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/talks/' | url }}">View all talks <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
  {% if site.demo %}<p class="demo-notice">Illustrative example talks are labelled individually.</p>{% endif %}
  <div class="talk-grid">{% if collections.upcoming.length %}{% set talks = collections.upcoming | take(3) %}{% else %}{% set talks = collections.talks | take(3) %}{% endif %}{% include 'cards.njk' %}</div>
  {% if not collections.talks.length %}<p>The next conversations are taking shape. Check back for the programme.</p>{% endif %}
</section>

<section class="explore-band" aria-labelledby="explore-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="explore-intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">02 · The thread that connects us</span>
      <h2 id="explore-heading">Good questions don’t stay in one discipline.</h2>
      <p>What does it mean to understand a mind? How do we design technology that understands us? LEACS brings cognitive science and human–computer interaction into the same room to share research, challenge assumptions, and find new perspectives.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">More about our approach <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <ul class="explore-grid">
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 16s5-9 13-9 13 9 13 9-5 9-13 9S3 16 3 16Z"/><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="4.5"/></svg><h3>Cognition &amp; behaviour</h3><p>Perception, attention, learning, and decision making: how people make sense of the world.</p></li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="6" width="24" height="16" rx="3"/><path d="m15 14 9 5-4 1-2 4-3-10Z"/><path d="M11 27h10"/></svg><h3>Human–computer interaction</h3><p>How people experience, use, and shape interactive systems.</p></li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="9" r="3"/><circle cx="24" cy="9" r="3"/><circle cx="16" cy="23" r="3"/><path d="M11 9h10M10 11.5l4.5 9M22 11.5l-4.5 9"/></svg><h3>Human-centred technology</h3><p>The relationship between people, intelligent systems, and design.</p></li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 5v22M5 16h22"/><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="9"/></svg><h3>Ideas in between</h3><p>Methods, theories, and emerging questions that connect these fields.</p></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section container" aria-labelledby="journal-heading">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">03 · Beyond the seminar</span><h2 id="journal-heading">Notes from the intersection.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/journal/' | url }}">Visit the journal <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
  <div class="journal-grid">{% set posts = collections.posts | take(2) %}{% set headingLevel = 3 %}{% include 'journal-cards.njk' %}</div>
</section>

<section class="container invite" aria-labelledby="invite-heading">
  <svg class="invite-scan" viewBox="0 0 400 200" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><polyline points="20,150 110,60 190,120 290,40 380,110"/><circle cx="20" cy="150" r="6"/><circle cx="110" cy="60" r="11"/><circle cx="190" cy="120" r="7"/><circle cx="290" cy="40" r="14"/><circle cx="380" cy="110" r="8"/></svg>
  <div><span class="eyebrow">Bring your perspective</span><h2 id="invite-heading">The next conversation could start with you.</h2><p>Have research to share, a question to explore, or an idea for a talk?</p></div>
  <a class="button button-bright" href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">Propose a talk <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</section>
